  "details": "1. Open radial menu with hand tracking.\n\n2. Move around, basically any speed above zero\n\n3. The laser will judder around making it impossible to click on anything, or at best click on random things.\n\nThe laser should be calculated in local space, but it feels more like it’s almost lagging behind in jittery steps as you move.\n\nThis goes from minor inconvenience to major problem if you have an avatar with a speed flight collider or something else that causes it to move continuously, because if you enable it, it becomes impossible to disable it because you can no longer use the radial menu.",
